  "summary": "The experiment tested replacing the RNA encoder with scvi_n200 in a multimodal multiprofile setup using avgpool aggregation and weighted fusion, building on a prior high-performing configuration (0.6390 validation accuracy). The result shows improved validation accuracy (0.6776) and F1 (0.6464), suggesting the RNA encoder choice may impact performance. Uncertainty remains about whether this improvement is consistent across other configurations or if other factors could influence the outcome."
}

